# tally 2.1.8 R14 (item 74), L §5.10, §8.4: last of a reading where two units' readings stand at its instant is
# RUN-DOMAIN at that ask, not a LOAD-OVERLAP of the whole file.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
unit EUR: currency minor 0.01
kind wallets: place any signed
place broker: wallets lives 2025-01-01..

version v1
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  anchor broker
  opening[broker] = 1.00 EUR at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[broker] = 2.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  stated[broker] = 4.00 EUR at 2026-02-15 end "s"
  stated[broker] = 10.00 PLN at 2026-02-15 end "s"

ask l: last(stated[broker], 2026-02-16)
=== expect
l: refused: RUN-DOMAIN last of broker: its readings at 2026-02-15 end are in EUR and PLN
  cut 2026-06-10
